<title>SINGAPORE: Sembawang changes name to SembCorp.</title>
<headline>Sembawang changes name to SembCorp.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diversified marine conglomerate, Sembawang Corporation Ltd, said on Friday it will be known as &quot;SembCorp&quot; from January 1, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
